  "title": "H&P Earns International Gold Quill Award for One Team, One Journey",
  "summary": "H&P was recognized with an International Gold Quill Award from the International Association of Business Communicators (IABC) for our One Team, One Journey campaign supporting the integration of H&P and KCA Deutag at its Annual World Conference. The Gold Quill Awards are among the most prestigious honors in the communications profession, recognizing excellence in strategic communication programs […]",
